WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.669
(GRATING AND RUMBLING)

00:00:05.604 --> 00:00:07.473
DAENERYS TARGARYEN:
<i> I know what my father was.</i>

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:08.741
<i> What he did.</i>

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:10.710
<i> I know the Mad King earned
 his name.</i>

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.078
-(ROARING)
-AERYS TARGARYEN:
<i> Burn them all!</i>

00:00:13.178 --> 00:00:14.947
♪ (TENSE MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

00:00:15.514 --> 00:00:17.750
ROBERT BARATHEON:
<i> I'll kill every Targaryen
 I get my hands on.</i>

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.119
CERSEI LANNISTER:
<i> Everyone who isn't us...</i>

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.454
<i> is an enemy.</i>

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:24.223
JOFFREY BARATHEON:<i> Ser Ilyn,
 bring me his head.</i>

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:28.294
BALON GREYJOY:<i> We are ironborn.
 We take what is ours.</i>

00:00:29.461 --> 00:00:31.531
ROOSE BOLTON:<i> The Lannisters
 send their regards.</i>

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:34.200
(CATELYN STARK SCREAMING)

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.369
OLENNA TYRELL:
<i> You don't think I'd let you
 marry that beast, do you?</i>

00:00:38.537 --> 00:00:40.940
HIGH SEPTON:
<i> I now proclaim Cersei
 of the House Lannister...</i>

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.207
(WHOOSHING)

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:44.576
<i>Protector of the Seven Kingdoms.</i>

00:00:45.644 --> 00:00:48.882
DAENERYS:<i> Lannister, Targaryen,
 Baratheon, Stark, Tyrell.</i>

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.184
<i> They're all just spokes
 on a wheel.</i>

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:53.252
<i> This one's on top,
 then that one's on top,</i>

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:55.421
<i> and on and on it spins.</i>

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:56.722
(GRATING)

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.524
<i> Crushing those on the ground.</i>

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:02.795
-(RUMBLING)
-(ROCKS CLATTERING)

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:05.565
NED STARK:<i> Same thing is coming
 for all of us.</i>

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:09.469
JON SNOW:<i> There's only one war
 that matters...</i>

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.073
<i> the Great War.</i>

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.475
<i> And it is here.</i>

